; Test when fneg (fmed3 a, b, 0.0) keeps the fneg on the result instead of
; negating every operand. Negating 0.0 needs -0.0, which is not an inline
; immediate.

; Without VOP3 literals, -0.0 needs an extra instruction, so fold the fneg into
; the single user. With VOP3 literals, v_med3 encodes -0.0 directly.
